SUMMARY:From Idea to Narrative: How We Write for Children's Hearts
DESCRIPTION:The session explores the process of transforming an idea into engaging narratives for children\, covering the key elements of building the story\, including the narrator's voice\, language and educational messages\, and how these components can foster a love of reading in children.
